）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大 (2020). 刑法（根据刑法修正案（十一）修正，第一百二十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://jtgl.beijing.gov.cn/jgj/jgxx/flfg/fl/11033925/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://jtgl.beijing.gov.cn/jgj/jgxx/flfg/fl/11033925/index.html"]},"；最高人民法院、最高人民检察院 (2018). 关于涉以压缩气体为动力的枪支、气枪铅弹刑事案件定罪量刑问题的批复（法释〔2018〕8 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/201803/t20180328_372604.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/201803/t20180328_372604.shtml"]},"；最高人民法院 (2018). 《批复》的理解与适用. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/88472.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/88472.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["那起案子不起诉的关键，是认定他们「不明知」。成年人特意上网买钢珠枪、气枪，事后再说不知道那是枪，很难成立。弩和管制刀具随身带的罚则，见本节第 26 条（别为了防身买甩棍、电击器、匕首）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/09-09"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 